)abbrev domain MISSCOND MissingCond
++ Test domain for the check for missing functions with conditional
++ exports and implementations (R has Field implies R has Ring):
++   foo1: exported if Ring,  implemented if Ring   -> ok
++   foo2: exported if Ring,  implemented if Field  -> missing if not Field
++   foo3: exported if Field, implemented if Ring   -> ok
++   foo4: exported if Field, not implemented       -> missing
MissingCond(R : SetCategory) : with
    if R has Ring then
        foo1 : () -> Integer
        foo2 : () -> Integer
    if R has Field then
        foo3 : () -> Integer
        foo4 : () -> Integer
  == add
    if R has Ring then
        foo1() == 1
        foo3() == 3
    if R has Field then
        foo2() == 2
